1717460031102_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qf_zvtFARBQQ7kNvwHnUEbV&_nc_oc=AdpBdK9ZpeQP1Ven3SXHbhtf6G2XxkBQmA84jTQWs2JMkru725O4-cK98Uq0UT3avrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7IvY2T19G5np69Yc38fwMAoYm7kiKlgGOX4k0J079m3g&oe=6A11A809"}, {"file_name": "meta-cf-kitchen-5.png", "id": "742664701973559", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622290_742664708640225_6956521530622514009_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g5BpovH7uVwQ7kNvwGWzPxV&_nc_oc=AdoC185NUlqrjwbRZBoxvhhP3l7aV9ozvsHPLCqsPTNhgoKfko1uKIwdq8BiSMr_tSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6CG1fx3qyPdjgkNOwvlISyAWEqE8qFTydmUeo-xPuuTw&oe=6A119C47"}, {"file_name": "meta-cf-kitchen-6.png", "id": "1830294280966710", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303391_1830294284300043_5466639759460132324_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m4VVGebYN7sQ7kNvwE5C2lp&_nc_oc=AdojBUnIn79NmuxOu89wb2OV6vt6qdz45v59Amf8Vzhk9mp2oGz_v-ig7AvKZc3jGJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4aCUsaRe1zesdvOiuy5cfZcc-efssepOFgjCA-DY5hcg&oe=6A11B0A5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "new-meta-landscape-cf.png", "id": "958406516571528", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307602_958406519904861_8357505864776864042_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CoNv4J29jlEQ7kNvwFd2yUO&_nc_oc=Ado3Mv4O7g5tOkxivC3lLGQCHDfNjFWghN9ZBMmskQ3A3x0DKCIrma7t_n2uJlNcS8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4xq3eDnae4RulQWxsf3xg4ngVVcHVysc1bf-lBODwRRw&oe=6A11C2CC"}, "display_name": "CrazyFish Chapter 6: Into the Kitchen", "keywords": ["crazyfish", "kitchen", "cooking", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Can you survive the chaos of the **CRAZYFISH KITCHEN**?\n- **Fast paced meal creation** - Chop, stir, bake, and serve before time runs out!\n- **Quirky grab mechanics** - No thumbs? No problem! Stretch, fling, and snatch your way to culinary glory.\n- **Ever-changing challenges** - Each level brings new recipes, obstacles, and kitchen madness.\n\n**Single player not enough? Team up with a friend and take multiplayer mayhem to the next level!**\n\nEarn stars as you cook and use them to customize your chef! Unlock wacky new heads or stylish hats!\n\nFrom chopping crisp lettuce to baking golden bread, you\u2019ll tackle a variety of recipes. But don\u2019t get too careless\u2026 one wrong move and the kitchen might just go up in flames!\n# GRAB NOW, EVOLVE LATER\n\nNo thumbs? No problem! Snatch, scoop, and secure ingredients using just your controllers; who needs thumbs anyway?\n{1297706162446129}\n# REACH BEYOND REASON\n\nDropped an item? Fear not! Launch items straight into your hands with a trigger pull and embrace your inner noodle-armed hero.\n{1300452858606902}\n# CUTTING EDGE CUISINE\n\nGrab a knife, chop those ingredients down to size, and try not to turn dinner into a disaster.\n{2098688720927149}\n# FROM CEREAL TO CULINARY HERO\n\nIf cereal counts as cooking, this game is your redemption arc. Chop, add, cook, and serve. Just be careful about the fire...\n{1998662781029560}\n# BAKING GONE WILD\n\nMix, bake... survive! Prep your ingredients, toss them in, and hope your creation doesn\u2019t turn the stove into a bonfire. From sweet treats to savory experiments, only the brave, or lucky, will serve up perfection.\n{1205030691701750}", "short_description": "Chop, cook, and serve meals in the CrazyFish Kitchen! Explore a new VR cooking challenge with never-before-seen item grabbing mechanics! Collect stars to unlock new levels and (coming soon) items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://crazyfish.io/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://crazyfish.io/#terms", "publisher_name": "SN1 LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crazyfish.io/", "category": null, "comfort_r